@1 = ~I will pretend I didn't hear that. Don't push your luck. Classy women are not that easy.~
@2 = ~(She blushes.) It... it's really sweet of you. I wish we could talk more, but... I think I should go.~
@3 = ~You shall experience more than just my wit, iblith. Mind your tongue if you wish to keep it. Pathetic peasant.~
@4 = ~Ehm, as charming as it is to hear, you might as well stop right there. There is no future in which you and I end up together. No hard feelings.~
@5 = ~Oh, lady of grace. I have yet to meet a princess such as you. Would you grant a handsome man like me the honour of escorting you to a tavern, so that we can...~
@6 = ~An elf of such clean complexion and fine figure is a rare sight in Athkatla... what am I saying? In all of Toril!~
@7 = ~Oh, lady of night, lady of dread, mistress of darkness. Your beauty is matched only by your wit, which I believe I shall experience first-hand.~
@8 = ~A pink-haired beauty such as yourself is truly a rare sight indeed. The way you carry yourself, those eyes in which one could get lost...~
@9 = ~If you find me some young elven blood, make sure to introduce us. I am a man of... exotic tastes.~
